# Vitae — Environment Variables
#
# All variables are optional. They enable the `vitae suggest` command
# for AI-powered resume content suggestions. Set one provider's key
# to enable — providers are checked in this order:

# Anthropic (Claude) — checked first
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# OpenAI (GPT) — checked second
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# Ollama (local) — checked third
# OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434
